<title>UK: BOE allots 325 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 325 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 325 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 325 million stg in repos to April 15 and 16.</p>
<p>The forecast shortage was revised to 2.1 billion pounds at midday from 2.0 billion in the early round.</p>
</text>
